OL,3,GNEWSAOver 2,000 properties still facing
OL,4,Awater disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver 2,000 properties in various parts
OL,7,Fof Kent are continuing to suffer from
OL,8,Fwater supply issues.
OL,10,FSouth East Water (SEW) apologised to
OL,11,F1,800 properties in the Benenden and
OL,12,FRolvenden area, which they said might
OL,13,Fbe experiencing low or no water
OL,14,Fpressure.
OL,16,FThe firm said a technical issue at a
OL,17,Flocal water treatment works overnight
OL,18,Fwas coupled with ongoing low levels in
OL,19,Fstorage tanks supplying the area.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
