OL,3,GNEWSAOver 2,000 properties still facing
OL,4,Awater disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FSEW added that a burst main in the
OL,7,FBethersden area overnight had resulted
OL,8,Fin low pressure or no water for around
OL,9,F585 properties in Woodchurch and the
OL,10,Fsurrounding areas.
